{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46969","headline":"渚宫西城池上居 · 齐己","name":"渚宫西城池上居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城东移锡住城西，绿遶春波引杖藜。\n翡翠满身衣有异，鹭鸶通体格非低。\n风摇柳眼开烟小，暖逼兰芽出土齐。\n犹有幽深不相似，剡溪乘櫂入耶溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}